(F5 T2 V3: print_element_geometry_present_node_type -plus_displacement,
 manual 6.976. The element translates rigidly at velx 0.2; at the start
 of the last step (t=0.5) the displacement is 0.1, so the displaced nodes
 x 0.1 / 1.1 lie in geometry_quadrilateral 7 (x 0.05 to 1.15) and the
 start coordinates x 0 / 1 do not. Expected: element_geometry_present 1
 -geometry_quadrilateral 7. The Professional 02-08-2026 rejects the word
 -plus_displacement (DIVERGENCES EGP-PLUS-DISP).)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
materi_stress
end_initia
node 1 0 0
node 2 1 0
node 3 0 1
node 4 1 1
element 1 -quad4 1 2 3 4
group_type 0 -materi
group_materi_memory 0 -total_linear
group_materi_elasti_young 0 1000.
group_materi_elasti_poisson 0 0.3
geometry_line 1 0 0 1 0 0.01
bounda_dof 0 -geometry_line 1 -vely
bounda_dof 1 -ra 1 4 -ra -velx
bounda_time 1 0.2
control_timestep 0 0.5 1.0
print_element_geometry_present -yes
print_element_geometry_present_node_type -plus_displacement
geometry_quadrilateral 7 0.05 -0.05 1.15 -0.05 0.05 1.05 1.15 1.05 0.001
end_data
